### 1d. Intent Match Validation
**Searcher intent:** The searcher wants a specific, scannable list of California cities with actual rent and home price figures so they can assess where they can afford to live given their budget.

**Primary intent:** Informational/comparative (discovery and early comparison stage). The searcher is not yet deciding between two specific cities; they are learning which geographic regions are affordable at all.

